1
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:06,039
I saved you a seat.

2
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:12,400
<i>When you live far apart, it's the little things you miss.</i>

3
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:24,039
You would've loved this.

4
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:33,194
<i>With SameSky, leave a little of your day for someone you love.</i>

5
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:56,529
[Maya, recorded message] I saw this and thought of you. Sit with me for a minute?

6
00:00:57,020 --> 00:01:01,597
<i>A familiar object. A voice waiting just for you.</i>

7
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:17,464
I wish I'd been there. Tell me everything.

8
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:30,314
You made it.

9
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:35,914
You saved me a seat.

10
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:42,029
<i>And when your days finally meet, share the same space.</i>

11
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:51,659
Same time tomorrow?

12
00:01:52,020 --> 00:01:53,959
Same seat.
